    <node id="范蠡">
      <data key="d0">范蠡</data>
      <data key="d1">人物</data>
      <data key="d2">范蠡 is a notable figure from the state of Yue during the historical period of the Warring States in ancient China. He is recognized as a strategist and advisor to King Goujian of Yue, playing a significant role in the kingdom's military and political maneuvers. His expertise in swordsmanship is well-documented, and he was known for his participation in swordsmanship competitions, showcasing his martial skills.

Often referred to as "范疯子" (Fan the Mad), he was perceived by some as eccentric, with a reputation for erratic behavior. Despite this, his intelligence and strategic acumen were highly valued, particularly in crisis situations where he demonstrated a keen ability to navigate complex challenges. He was a formidable opponent to the envoys of the state of Wu, indicating his importance in diplomatic and military confrontations.

范蠡's character is further illustrated through his relationships with others, particularly with a young woman named 阿青 (Aqing). He is depicted as a caring individual who shows concern for her well-being, willing to assist her and her mother. His interactions with 阿青 reveal a more personal side, as he is portrayed as a friend who observes and comments on her swordsmanship, while also harboring complex feelings and intentions to protect her.

In addition to his strategic and martial prowess, 范蠡 is also noted for his leadership in military campaigns, specifically leading the Yue forces against Wu. His multifaceted role as a warrior, strategist, and friend highlights the complexity of his character and contributions to the state of Yue during a tumultuous period in Chinese history.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3b2a680eed881fd86d938031d895d21e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f36e0abe52b904e30fbb2a78b9a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42c3e318eb3b9f5e9c1bd450e13ff5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3e590b3ab7f94ee3770d3739196401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f4631a6bc7286dd9560f06b9845d9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a72fd2ce03a23a58c65d98d2258f3e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66</data>
